/**
 * @file
 * TritonLED Configurator module.
 *
 * Provides a custom order item type (configurator_item) for quote-based
 * LED luminaire ordering. The configurator reads a JSON schema from
 * field_configurator_schema on commerce_product, renders step-by-step
 * dropdowns with dependsOn logic, builds the SKU dynamically in JS,
 * and adds the result directly to cart as a configurator_item order item.
 *
 * No Commerce product variations are required.
 *
 * @see /docs/tasks/task-015-session-plan.md
 * @see /docs/tasks/task-015-konfigurator-arkitektur.md
 */
